  "ingredients": [
    "12 ounces chopped raw bacon",
    "1 small white onion, chopped",
    "5 button mushrooms, chopped",
    "1.5 pounds extra-lean ground beef",
    "0.25 cup evaporated milk",
    "1 egg",
    "6 ounces shredded Swiss cheese, divided",
    "0.5 cup corn flake crumbs"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cp3s_qqHwPLDMqmOVNynJ9Nc-Ds=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/87156-bacon-mushroom-swiss-meatloaf-VAT-step-01-5035237abf0b4865b2e83539512f99ea.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/87156/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook and stir bacon in a skillet over medium heat until browned. Transfer to a paper-towel-lined plate with a slotted spoon; set aside 1 tablespoon bacon. Discard all but 1 tablespoon drippings from the skillet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dCbWrJ2wxlmNzbzFB7d3f-L9XSY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/87156-bacon-mushroom-swiss-meatloaf-VAT-step-02-1b39c8f353ec4fdd9db79ee77e2544f2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/87156/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add onion and mushrooms to the skillet; cook until soft.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jSJrD_CmqHemePi2UcOJmeqPGhA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/87156-bacon-mushroom-swiss-meatloaf-VAT-step-03-0d69ceb742544fd38d328b89d4a6d2f4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/87156/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine beef, milk, and egg in a large bowl. Stir in onion and mushrooms. Add about 4 ounces Swiss cheese and all but 1 tablespoon bacon; stir to combine. Stir in cornflake crumbs until well blended.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/SgwMJ9jxVWb0M_lFC0bAAX3DY0I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/87156-bacon-mushroom-swiss-meatloaf-VAT-step-04-eadc36c3087945fbb43ad99494787f83.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/87156/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Shape into a loaf; place in a meatloaf pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rNLddnZJT7W_03Mx5kjRJNDAeDQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/87156-bacon-mushroom-swiss-meatloaf-VAT-step-05-44909d5993014b1aa5ed670b8c74d8ad.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/87156/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven for 1 hour. Drain fat; sprinkle with remaining 2 ounces Swiss cheese and reserved 1 tablespoon bacon. Continue baking until cheese is melted, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/b-sdWczTwfsXwW86v5UU4khD9f0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/87156-bacon-mushroom-swiss-meatloaf-VAT-step-06-9c442894fd824c7b80e473737e5dbddf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/87156/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Let meatloaf rest for a few minutes to make it easier to slice. Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/85Bt40XwVw7Le0FdjaZpAD2QMCY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/87156-bacon-mushroom-swiss-meatloaf-VAT-step-07-59ebc628456545b996ea42ab3d3f26dd.jpg"
